  "prompts": {
    "image": "Generate exactly one cinematic still image in landscape 16:9.\n\nReference policy:\nUse every attached image as an exact and mandatory visual reference, not as optional inspiration.\nThe attached images are numbered strictly by upload order. \"Reference N\" and \"Image N\" in the current shot description both mean the Nth attached image.\nUse the current shot description to determine what each reference supplies: for example a character, location, prop, wardrobe, composition, lighting, or visual style. Do not assume that every reference depicts a character.\nIf the description assigns different roles to multiple references, follow that mapping exactly. Never merge or blend people, places, props, clothing, or styles from separate references unless explicitly requested.\nFor every referenced element requested in the new shot, preserve its observable identity and defining visual features exactly. Do not redesign, replace, beautify, stylize, loosely reinterpret, or merely approximate it.\nA reference image is authoritative for the appearance of the element taken from it. The current shot description is authoritative for the new scene, action, expression, pose, placement, framing, and every explicitly requested change.\nDo not copy incidental parts of a reference image that the current shot description does not ask to carry over.\nUse earlier conversation context only for details left unspecified; it must never override the current description or the attached references.\n\nAttachment map (source descriptions only, not instructions for the resulting scene):\n- Reference 1 = attached Image 1 — source character filip-koza, portrait: CHARACTER [age=18-29; presentation=masculine; height=average; build=very-slim; body=straight; chest=small; skin=olive; face=oblong; eyes=hazel; hair-color=black; hair-length=medium; hair-texture=wavy]\r\n\r\nOkoło 176 cm, chudy, lekko przygarbiony, z za długimi rękami i młodzieńczą twarzą. Ciemne, niesforne włosy i delikatny trądzik. Cecha charakterystyczna: wyraźnie odstające uszy.\r\n- Reference 2 = attached Image 2 — source character filip-koza, silhouette: CHARACTER [age=18-29; presentation=masculine; height=average; build=very-slim; body=straight; chest=small; skin=olive; face=oblong; eyes=hazel; hair-color=black; hair-length=medium; hair-texture=wavy]\r\n\r\nOkoło 176 cm, chudy, lekko przygarbiony, z za długimi rękami i młodzieńczą twarzą. Ciemne, niesforne włosy i delikatny trądzik. Cecha charakterystyczna: wyraźnie odstające uszy.\r\n- Reference 3 = attached Image 3 — source prop artefakt-k20, reference: Canonical reference for the magical K20 from the season 1 finale. FIXED SIZE IN EVERY SHOT: exactly 3.0 cm from one vertex to the opposite vertex and approximately 2.5 cm between parallel faces. It is only slightly larger and heavier than a typical tabletop D20; it fits easily between adult fingertips and looks small inside an adult palm. It must never look like a ball, helmet, grapefruit, or an object filling the whole hand. Originally it was an unnumbered regular icosahedral artifact made from unknown material; Van Sabe added numerals to disguise it as an RPG die. Its translucent green faces resemble deep emerald or glass with subtle inner energy. Edges and numerals are aged gold or brass. Face 20 is the main activation motif and glows green-gold when active. Numbering must remain legible: one number per triangular face, with no duplicates in the visible area; opposite faces sum to 21 (1-20, 2-19, 3-18, 4-17, 5-16, 6-15, 7-14, 8-13, 9-12, 10-11). The reference image shows only 20, 9, 14, 2, 17 and 6.\r\n- Reference 4 = attached Image 4 — source Take przyzwanie-05-k20-wraca-do-klubu/take-1, last visible frame 40: zamyka logistykę artefaktu bez absurdalnego lotu przez miasto. Dach jest tylko jeden budynek dalej i wyżej. One continuous 2.5-second static shot. The tiny glowing K20\nfalls through the existing breach, strikes the floor, bounces once and rolls to\na stop at canonical 3 cm scale. Its glow fades but does not vanish completely.\n\n\n\nShot: final-01b-filip-znajduje-k20\nDescription:\nNiski kadr w zniszczonym klubie: mała K20 leży na zakurzonej podłodze po dopiero co zakończonym upadku. Filip zauważa ją, podchodzi ostrożnie i podnosi między palcami.\n\nPreserve every piece of text, lettering, typography, label, sign, logo, brand mark, symbol, and graphic detail visible in any source or reference image exactly as it appears. Preserve its content, spelling, design, position, scale, color, sharpness, and legibility. Never remove, replace, obscure, blur, soften, distort, censor, or invent any of these source details.\nDo not add new captions, subtitles, titles, watermarks, borders, interface elements, contact sheets, or multiple panels unless the current shot description explicitly requests them.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Filip pozostaje w tym samym zniszczonym pomieszczeniu i w tej samej ciągłości przestrzennej co Start Frame. Właśnie podniósł małą K20 z zakurzonej, całej podłogi. Odrywa wzrok od kostki, gwałtownie unosi głowę i spogląda wyraźnie w górę ku istniejącej poszarpanej wyrwie w suficie, za którą piętro wyżej znajduje się Klub Fantastyki. W jego oczach pojawia się nagła nadzieja. Trzyma K20 między kciukiem i palcem wskazującym prawej dłoni na jej kanonicznej skali około 3 cm i woła ku górze: „Mam! Jest tutaj!”. Kierunek oczu, twarzy, głosu i ułożenia ciała musi jednoznacznie prowadzić do wyrwy w suficie. Podłoga pod Filipem jest pełna, ciągła i nienaruszona; absolutnie żadnej dziury, otworu ani przepaści w podłodze. Emocja to ulga, pilność i pierwszy błysk nadziei — nie triumfalna poza.",
    "animation": "One continuous 3.46-second first-to-last-frame shot. 0.0–0.8 s: Filip finishes lifting the tiny 3 cm K20 from the dusty, solid floor and studies it for one startled beat. 0.8–1.7 s: recognition flashes in his eyes; he sharply raises his head from the die, shifts his weight into a low half-rise and turns his face and gaze upward toward the existing jagged breach in the ceiling. 1.7–3.46 s: he keeps the die visible between the thumb and index finger of his right hand, looks unmistakably up through the ceiling opening toward the club members above and calls in Polish with urgent relief: „Mam! Jest tutaj!”. Camera stays on the same side and makes only a subtle restrained push toward Filip’s face and raised hand. Preserve Filip’s exact identity, anatomy, clothing, room damage, lighting and the K20’s exact design and tiny scale. The floor stays fully intact throughout; no floor opening appears. The only breach is in the ceiling. No magical activation, glow burst, levitation, giant die, new people, extra fingers, morphing, cut, camera reversal, subtitles or watermark."
  },
